    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/0791877b17369502cf602ed15214eb8b.poster.avif?t=1755086994\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/0791877b17369502cf602ed15214eb8b.webm?t=1755086994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/0791877b17369502cf602ed15214eb8b.mp4?t=1755086994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/b8e4097f0ec52bc513e9daad83c756a3.avif?t=1755086994\" width=721 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The plague has descended upon the city of Ludwig. You are a plague doctor \u2014 the last barrier between life and chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a doctor in a dying city. Diagnose, heal, and make brutal decisions. Impose quarantines, burn infected houses, fight panic and rumors. Every action has a price \u2014 and not everyone will survive it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/d7d4f4e08f3d7d51f0e1ba03801002ea.avif?t=1755086994\" width=721 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The plague spares neither the poor nor the noble. Ludwig is drowning in death, panic, and despair. You\u2019re not just fighting the disease \u2014 you\u2019re fighting what it leaves behind: lies, fear, madness, and bodies no one dares to bury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/78016f9abb2a92064b98ec508966b637.avif?t=1755086994\" width=721 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a doctor in Ludwig is dangerous \u2014 but profitable. Every patient is willing to pay for a chance to survive. Buy rare recipes, mix ingredients, craft powerful remedies, and improve your skills. Become the best physician\u2026 at least for those who can still be saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds week by week, and each patient brings a new challenge. From beggars to nobles \u2014 everyone needs your help. Diagnose illnesses, treat them through tense mini-games, and brew potions in your old distiller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/b88e7a5e4e343558f3dc0d73d8108c2f.poster.avif?t=1755086994\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/b88e7a5e4e343558f3dc0d73d8108c2f.webm?t=1755086994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/b88e7a5e4e343558f3dc0d73d8108c2f.mp4?t=1755086994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only companion is a crow named Bane. He mocks, advises, ridicules, and comments on your every move\u2026 but only you can hear him. Is he a clever ally, a symptom of madness, or the voice of your conscience?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/e4587ef5c339982a15a519281b4f2958.avif?t=1755086994\" width=721 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Book of Plagues</strong> is a dark and deeply atmospheric game that blends moral dilemmas, black humor, and the madness of the medieval world. Inspired by the chronicles of the Black Death and classic literature, it throws you into the heart of an epidemic where every choice has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you become the city\u2019s savior \u2014 or its final sentence? Add to your wishlist and don\u2019t miss the coming of the Plague.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/0791877b17369502cf602ed15214eb8b.poster.avif?t=1755086994\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/0791877b17369502cf602ed15214eb8b.webm?t=1755086994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/0791877b17369502cf602ed15214eb8b.mp4?t=1755086994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/b8e4097f0ec52bc513e9daad83c756a3.avif?t=1755086994\" width=721 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The plague has descended upon the city of Ludwig. You are a plague doctor \u2014 the last barrier between life and chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a doctor in a dying city. Diagnose, heal, and make brutal decisions. Impose quarantines, burn infected houses, fight panic and rumors. Every action has a price \u2014 and not everyone will survive it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/d7d4f4e08f3d7d51f0e1ba03801002ea.avif?t=1755086994\" width=721 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The plague spares neither the poor nor the noble. Ludwig is drowning in death, panic, and despair. You\u2019re not just fighting the disease \u2014 you\u2019re fighting what it leaves behind: lies, fear, madness, and bodies no one dares to bury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/78016f9abb2a92064b98ec508966b637.avif?t=1755086994\" width=721 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a doctor in Ludwig is dangerous \u2014 but profitable. Every patient is willing to pay for a chance to survive. Buy rare recipes, mix ingredients, craft powerful remedies, and improve your skills. Become the best physician\u2026 at least for those who can still be saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds week by week, and each patient brings a new challenge. From beggars to nobles \u2014 everyone needs your help. Diagnose illnesses, treat them through tense mini-games, and brew potions in your old distiller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/b88e7a5e4e343558f3dc0d73d8108c2f.poster.avif?t=1755086994\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/b88e7a5e4e343558f3dc0d73d8108c2f.webm?t=1755086994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/b88e7a5e4e343558f3dc0d73d8108c2f.mp4?t=1755086994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only companion is a crow named Bane. He mocks, advises, ridicules, and comments on your every move\u2026 but only you can hear him. Is he a clever ally, a symptom of madness, or the voice of your conscience?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538250/extras/e4587ef5c339982a15a519281b4f2958.avif?t=1755086994\" width=721 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Book of Plagues</strong> is a dark and deeply atmospheric game that blends moral dilemmas, black humor, and the madness of the medieval world. Inspired by the chronicles of the Black Death and classic literature, it throws you into the heart of an epidemic where every choice has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you become the city\u2019s savior \u2014 or its final sentence? Add to your wishlist and don\u2019t miss the coming of the Plague.</strong></p>",
